}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.example.org/muac/ontology/local-moo#Functional_Exchange",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "https://mbse-capella.org/resources/arcadia-reference/Arcadia%20Language%20-%20MetaModel.pdf\nA possible interaction between a source function and a destination function, likely to transmit exchange items through their output and input ports, respectively\n\nA Functional Exchange represents the connection (the 'what' and 'where') between two functions, defining the flow of data, material, or signals."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
