  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "1. It is a composite flow.\n2.It must contain at least one business Task (ensuring it isn't an empty process).\n3.Crucially, every single block inside it must exclusively be a Task that has a assigned, responsible Operational_Actor attached to it."
